{"ID":"20240314091835-39pifmg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091835-39pifmg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091835-39pifmg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170442-tkyv1k5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170442-5o7ujdj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170442-5o7ujdj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:22,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:22\u0026#125;","title":"【黄连粉】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170442-tkyv1k5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-tkyv1k5","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"浸淫疮，从口流向四肢者，可治；从四肢流来人口老，不可治。浸淫疮，黄连粉主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-slesem8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-slesem8","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连粉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-61o68db","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-61o68db","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连一两，薏仁五钱，白术五钱，冬瓜仁三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-golh937","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-golh937","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"打粉外用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-23lnv2k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-23lnv2k","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第十八篇呢，最后一讲浸淫疮。所谓的浸淫疮，他为什么用浸淫疮...我们皮肤病如果你去看西医的皮肤病的书，哇，一大票，分析的很细哦。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金匮里面呢他不这样讲。所谓浸淫疮就是生在你皮肤上的疮，慢慢侵蚀你的身体，这样想就好了，不要把它当成病，不要把它看成病名在说"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。而是所有的疮，由体外往内走的时候都是不好治，由嘴巴、由身体里面往四肢上走的时候，这是比较好治。反过来，如果这个病呢本来是在身上，吃了你的药以后，诶，往四肢上蔓延，代表病在恢复中间。痛也是一样，比如说这个人呢原来背痛，你帮他扎完针以后，诶，他如果背不痛了痛到肩膀上来了，你再扎同样的穴道，他说肩膀不痛了背也不痛了我现在手臂痛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"由身体往外走了，统统都是顺，都是好，都是在好转的中间。如果病是由四肢一直往里面走，代表更严重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-qkqdbse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-qkqdbse","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们在治疗比如说破伤风，或者是毒蛇咬到你，他一直往身上走那就是越来越严重。这个浸淫疮呢，这个黄连粉，是外用药。原来的方子缺了。所以诸位在念完伤寒金匮以后呢，我希望大家多看一点书，我们有很多的书可以看，当你有了经方的基础，这时再看外面的书不会迷惑你。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-dcoh9kl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-dcoh9kl","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那黄连粉的汤方我找到了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连一两，薏仁五钱，白术五钱，冬瓜仁三钱，这四味药打粉，这是外用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。薏仁、白术是不是收敛湿的？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"白术呢比较接近于肌肉里面的湿，薏仁呢是皮肤上面的湿。冬瓜仁呢，是润肺的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以说如果这几味药配在一起的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄连是消炎的嘛，镇痛的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个药用到冬瓜仁的话，长出来新的皮肤就会很漂亮，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"消炎、去湿的同时呢，把皮肤新鲜的皮肤长回来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，当时我看到这个处方的之后...很久了，我真的忘了是什么书上面看到，我一看就知道这是黄连粉，就知道这个汤方跑掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-o2n3qdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-o2n3qdb","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以过去呢，经方是有，但可能散失到别的人书里去了，有的人那个竹简嘛，好抽嘛，就抽一个放在口袋里跑掉了，可能是这样子的，我都不知道，把它找回来就好了嘛，历史不可考，那基本上，大致这个浸淫疮，就介绍到这里。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170442-5o7ujdj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170442-5o7ujdj","updated":"20240422170442"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好，我们今天就介绍到这里，明天再继续下一篇。"}]}]}